---
import Section from "@/components/ui/Section.astro";
---

<Section id="core-value" alt containerClass="narrow center">
  <p class="eyebrow">Our core value</p>
  <h2>Our work begins with intention.</h2>
  <div class="card accent">
    <p class="arabic" lang="ar" dir="rtl">
      قُلْ إِنَّ صَلَاتِي وَنُسُكِي وَمَحْيَايَ وَمَمَاتِي لِلَّهِ رَبِّ
      الْعَالَمِينَ
    </p>
    <p class="quote">
      “Say, ‘Indeed, my prayer, my rites of sacrifice, my living and my
      dying are for Allah, Lord of the worlds.’”
    </p>
    <p class="muted">Surah Al-An'am (6:162)</p>
  </div>
  <p class="note">
    This verse is the foundation of our work. We believe our time,
    knowledge, skills, and efforts are part of our lives, and we strive
    to dedicate them to Allah.
  </p>
  <p>
    Through Sadaqah Code, we aim to make our work in technology a means
    of benefit for the Ummah — building useful tools, sharing knowledge,
    and contributing to lasting good.
  </p>
</Section>
